      "finalAnswer": "(c) $-1+i$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "$\\sum i^n(1+i) = (1+i) \\sum_{n=1}^{13} i^n$.",
        "Sum of 4 consecutive powers of $i$ is 0. $i^1 + \\dots + i^{12} = 0$.",
        "Remaining term $i^{13} = i$.",
        "Result: $(1+i)(i) = i + i^2 = -1+i$."
      ]
